      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تثوّب</span></b> : ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَثَيَّبَتْ</span>: see 2, in the latter
part of the paragraph. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  The former also signifies
<i>He gained,</i> or <i>earned, a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَوَاب</span> [or <i>recompense,</i>
&amp;c.]. (K.) But this is said to be post-classical.
(MF.)

